  "text": "Contact | Modalis Therapeutics - Official Site Skip to content Home About Message from CEO Company History Leadership Business Pipeline Science Gene Therapy Genome Editing:CRISPR Science epigenome CRISPR-GNDM® Patients Investors Message IR News IR Library IR Governance IR Calendar Stock FAQ Email Alerts Careers Contact EN JP EN Contact Home Contact Contact In response to the content of your inquiry 1）This page is protected by encryption technology (SSL). 2）Depending on the content of your inquiry, it may take some time for us to confirm the facts and circumstances of your inquiry. We may not be able to provide a response depending on the content of the inquiry. In particular, please understand that we are not able to provide answers regarding the diagnosis or treatment of illnesses. 3）If you do not fill in your personal information correctly, we may not be able to respond to your inquiry. 4）Our reply is intended for the person who made the inquiry. Please refrain from disclosing all or part of the content of our response to anyone other than the person who made the inquiry through secondary use, such as diversion, posting, or use as content on other websites, without our consent. 5）Our website is created for the purpose of providing information on our business and pipeline under development to a wide range of stakeholders. We ask that you make investment decisions at your own discretion and responsibility. 6）Please be aware that we are not able to contact you with individual inquiries about our business, the progress of our pipeline under development, or disclose information, as we must ensure the fairness of the information disclosed to investors. When we receive an inquiry, we will discuss whether it is appropriate to publish and disclose the content that we judge to be appropriate on our website or disclosure information. Inquiries to which we deem appropriate to respond will be disclosed on our website or disclosure information. Please refer to our website, IR site, published disclosure documents, and press releases. 7）We are not able to offer any opinion on the current or future stock price or provide investment advice. Please be aware that we disclose information required to be disclosed by law in a timely manner, and that we may be not able to disclose any unpublished information that we are not in a position to disclose. 8）Inquiries regarding sales of products, etc. are strictly prohibited. Attention regarding the inquiry form Upon completion of your inquiry, a confirmation e-mail will be automatically sent to you. If you do not receive a confirmation email, please see below for possible scenarios resulting in you not receiving your confirmation. ・Contacting us from a cell phone email address. ・Please remove your settings to block incoming e-mails, or make sure that e-mails from our domain “modalistx.com” are not recognized as spam mail. ・An error in the e-mail address you entered. ・Please check your e-mail address and contact us again using the inquiry form. ・If you are using anti-virus or security software ・Please check your spam folder or deleted items to make sure that the e-mail has not been sent to your spam folder or deleted items. Handling of personal information We will use your personal information for the following purposes. ・To confirm and respond to inquiries. Although the provision of information is voluntary, we may not be able to provide services if insufficient information is provided. For more information, please refer to our Privacy Policy page. Privacy Policy Disagree Agree and inquire About Message from CEO Company History Leadership Business Pipeline Science Gene Therapy Genome Editing:CRISPR Science epigenome CRISPR-GNDM® News Patients Investors Message Stock IR Governance IR Library IR Calendar FAQ Careers Contact About Message from CEO Company History Leadership Business Pipeline Science Gene Therapy Genome Editing: CRISPR Science Epigenome CRISPR-GNDM® Patient News Investors Message